Dr. Prof. Sheng‑Li Huang  received his Ph.D. in chemistry from Fudan University, and he is currently a research professor in Beijing Institute of Technology. His research interests mainly focus on coordination chemistry, cluster chemistry, supramolecular chemistry, structural chemistry and photocatalysis.
Dr.Prof. Guo‑Yu Yang  received his Ph.D. from Jilin University, and he is a distinguished professor in Beijing Institute of Technology. His research interests focus on (1) oxo cluster chemistry including transition-metal, main group and lanthanide clusters; (2) cluster-organic frameworks; and (3) porous and nonlinear optical materials built by oxo cluster units.
